  "body": "This beautifully presented townhouse offers the perfect blend of comfort, convenience, and low-maintenance living. It’s a great option for first-home buyers, investors, young families, or those looking to downsize.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned opposite Bonair Park, you'll wake up to peaceful park views while enjoying all the convenience of modern living. Schools and the park are just a short stroll away, with shops, public transport, and motorway access all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n• 3 well-sized bedrooms, including a master suite\r\n\r\n• 2.5 bathrooms, including a family bathroom, an ensuite and a separate guest toilet downstairs\r\n\r\n• Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living area\r\n\r\n• Modern kitchen with quality appliances and ample storage\r\n\r\n• Sunny deck flowing from the living area, perfect for entertaining or relaxing in the sun\r\n\r\n• Single garage\r\n\r\nWith its fantastic location, easy-care design, and everyday convenience, this home is ready for its next owners. Contact us today for more information or come along to our open home.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
